---
layout: base.njk
title: About — Elysium+ Network
description: Meet the people behind Elysium+ — a European youth network with branches in Ukraine, Poland, Italy and Germany, and read our story and frequently asked questions.
permalink: /about/
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-paper border-b-2 border-ink">
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 pt-14 pb-16 text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--coral-ink)">About us</p>
    <h1 class="h-hero mt-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">The people behind <mark class="m-blue">Elysium+</mark></h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">A group of young, motivated people who build the projects, initiatives and activities that shape the network. Each member brings unique skills — together we make it work.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-paper border-b-2 border-ink">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start reveal">
      <div><h2 class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--coral-ink)">Our story</h2></div>
      <div class="sm:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p>Elysium+ began as a school initiative in <strong>2020</strong> and grew into a registered NGO in Ukraine in <strong>2025</strong>. From those first steps the mission has stayed the same: to promote European values, intercultural dialogue, civic engagement and personal development among young people.</p>
        <p>Today Elysium+ is a European network with branches in <strong>Ukraine, Poland, Italy and Germany</strong> — each responding to young people in its own context while sharing partners, values and a common purpose.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-paper-2 border-b-2 border-ink">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="text-center reveal"><p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--coral-ink)">Meet the team</p><h2 class="h-sec mt-3">The people building Elysium+</h2></div>
    <div class="grid gap-7 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 mt-12">
      {% set rot = ["-2deg","1.5deg","-1deg","2deg"] %}
      {% for m in site.team %}
      <div class="card overflow-hidden reveal reveal-d{{ (loop.index0 % 4) + 1 }}" style="transform:rotate({{ rot[loop.index0 % 4] }})">
        <img src="{{ m.image }}" alt="{{ m.name }}" loading="lazy" class="w-full h-64 object-cover border-b-2 border-ink">
        <div class="p-5">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">{{ m.name }}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold mt-0.5" style="color:var(--coral-ink)">{{ m.role }}</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">{{ m.bio }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-paper border-b-2 border-ink">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <h2 class="h-sec text-center mb-10 reveal">Frequently asked</h2>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      {% for f in site.faqs %}
      <details class="group card !rounded-xl px-6 py-1 reveal" {% if loop.index0 == 0 %}open{% endif %}>
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none py-5">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold">{{ f[0] }}</h3>
          <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 grid place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-ink group-open:bg-blue transition">{% icon "chevron", "w-4 h-4 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" %}</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="pb-6 -mt-1 leading-relaxed">{{ f[1] }}</p>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pb-20 sm:pb-24 pt-4">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-10 sm:p-16 text-center reveal border-2 border-ink" style="background:var(--sun);box-shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--ink)">
      <h2 class="h-sec">Want to get involved?</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
        <a href="{{ site.join_form }}" class="btn btn-ink">Join Us {% icon "arrow-ur", "w-4 h-4" %}</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn">Contact us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
